{"ID":"20240205171631-htvr1bp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205171631-htvr1bp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171631-htvr1bp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171646-iwahqmo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613084116-ta5o1a8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205171646-iwahqmo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"283白敛（白蔹）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823102957"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205171646-iwahqmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171646-iwahqmo","updated":"20240205171704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產湖北、河南、江西、安徽等地。\n【性狀】\t塊根長圓形或紡錘形，多縱切成瓣或斜片。完整者長512cm，直徑1.53.5cm。表面紅棕色或紅褐色，有縱皺紋、細橫紋及橫長皮孔，栓皮易層層脫落，脫落處顯淡紅棕色，剖面類白色或淡紅棕色，皺縮不平。斜片呈卵圓形，長2.55cm，寬23cm，切面類白色或淺紅棕色，中部有一突起棱線，可見放射狀紋理，周邊較厚，微翹起或略彎曲翻卷。體輕，質硬脆，易折斷粉性。氣微，味微甜。\n【性味】\t味苦、甘、辛，微寒。\n【功效】\t清熱解毒；散結止痛；生肌斂瘡。用治瘡瘍腫毒，瘰鬁，燙傷，濕瘡，溫瘧，驚癇，血痢，腸風，痔漏，白帶，跌打損傷，外傷出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240205171643-zymytfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205171643-zymytfa","updated":"20240205171643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205171643-kaslndc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823102123-c7p2b8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823102123-c7p2b8n","updated":"20240823102204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白敛"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白敛-20240823102123-zss5tta.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 576px;","style":"width: 566px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白敛 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白敛 1-20240823102204-thjt943.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 566px;\" parent-style=\"width: 576px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823102248-5aqsji5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823102248-5aqsji5","updated":"20240823102251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白敛 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白敛 2-20240823102248-bj0vcox.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 439px;","style":"width: 429px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白蔹根"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白蔹根-20240628172941-dfee616.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 429px;\" parent-style=\"width: 439px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240823103558-2dnrfwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823103558-2dnrfwn","updated":"20240823104042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 552px;","style":"width: 542px;"},"Children":[{"Type":